## Tab: verbs

<tab route="/reference/verbs/$band">
<purpose>Verb conjugation system, band by band</purpose>
<file>src/routes/reference/verbs/route.tsx (layout), src/routes/reference/verbs/$band.tsx</file>
<components>
- PresentTenseSection, PastTenseSection, PastContinuousSection, FutureNaSection (components/verbs-section.tsx)
</components>
<displays>
- Hero (in the layout): "Three patterns, thousands of verbs."
- NavTabs over the bands: Present · Past · Continuous past · Future & να
- Present: είμαι, pattern identifier, the three families (-ω, -άω/-ώ, -μαι), other high-frequency verbs, link to /learn/verbs
- Past: aorist finder, exceptions, formation rules, full paradigms (collapsible), stems that break the rules
- Continuous past: imperfect paradigms and the aorist vs imperfect contrast
- Future & να: θα + subjunctive, ladders, να-constructions
- PracticeCTA topic "verbs" → /practice/verbs (in the layout, so on every band)
</displays>
<note>
This explains the conjugation SYSTEM. Verb vocabulary browsing is at /learn/verbs.
</note>
</tab>

