## Navigation Order

Tabs appear in `REFERENCE_TABS` order (conceptual dependency):
1. cases - Framework: what each ending is for
2. articles - The Cases tab reads the case off the article, so articles come next
3. nouns - Noun endings by gender
4. pronouns - Cases in the words you use most
5. adjectives - Agreement following article/noun patterns
6. prepositions - Combines with articles/pronouns
7. verbs - Separate system (conjugation)
8. patterns - Special constructions

The landing page groups the same topics differently (pronouns sit with cases under "The case system").
